WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:19.638
"Brakes?" cried Zippy.

2
00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:25.621
"Brakes are boring!"

3
00:00:25.622 --> 00:00:28.941
Eddy didn't like Zippy.

4
00:00:28.942 --> 00:00:31.735
But Zippy was right.

5
00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:34.962
Brakes were boring.

6
00:00:34.963 --> 00:00:39.654
"Brakes are very important," said Mr. Grill.

7
00:00:39.655 --> 00:00:45.046
"First we must check them."

8
00:00:45.047 --> 00:00:49.024
The teacher drove slowly.

9
00:00:49.025 --> 00:00:52.643
Then he stopped.

10
00:00:52.644 --> 00:00:55.101
"See?" he said.

11
00:00:55.102 --> 00:00:57.511
"My brakes work.

12
00:00:57.512 --> 00:01:04.835
Now you all try."

13
00:01:04.836 --> 00:01:12.048
Most students checked their brakes.

14
00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:14.606
But Zippy didn't.

15
00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:18.294
"My brakes are fine," said Zippy.

16
00:01:18.295 --> 00:01:23.383
"I don't need to check them."

17
00:01:23.384 --> 00:01:39.089
Mr. Grill drove around the parking lot.

18
00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:46.142
"Use brakes when you turn," he said.

19
00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:48.914
Mr. Grill slowed down.

20
00:01:48.915 --> 00:01:50.716
He made a turn.

21
00:01:50.717 --> 00:01:54.846
Then he went faster.

22
00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:57.717
"Ugh," said Zippy.

23
00:01:57.718 --> 00:02:00.756
"Race cars never slow down."

24
00:02:00.757 --> 00:02:03.302
"Yeah!" said Eddy.

25
00:02:03.303 --> 00:02:08.695
"I won't check my brakes either."
